352
00:34:13,343 --> 00:34:14,762
Gracias. Que la pase bien.

353
00:34:14,845 --> 00:34:16,180
De nada. Gracias.

354
00:34:25,981 --> 00:34:26,732
Hola.

355
00:35:09,066 --> 00:35:09,691
¿Kramer?

356
00:35:10,776 --> 00:35:11,777
Oye.

357
00:35:12,986 --> 00:35:14,530
