371
00:36:32,774 --> 00:36:35,360
Vivir o morir. Tú decides.

372
00:36:38,530 --> 00:36:39,364
No.

373
00:36:39,448 --> 00:36:40,699
No.

374
00:36:40,782 --> 00:36:41,700
Kramer.

375
00:36:42,659 --> 00:36:43,702
¡Kramer!

376
00:36:43,785 --> 00:36:45,662
¡Kramer!

377
00:36:45,746 --> 00:36:47,623
¡Kramer!

378
00:39:35,957 --> 00:39:37,542
Vas a estar bien.

379
00:39:40,462 --> 00:39:41,588
Detective.

380
00:39:41,671 --> 00:39:44,049
